*> Writes reconciliation.rpt: diag/reconciliation.rpt always, and a copy in
*> work/out/ when the run produced an output tree (RC 0/4/8, full run). Counts
*> are zero-padded to 9 digits. An aborted run (RC 12) gets only RUN, RC, CAUSE.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RECONRPT.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT D-RPT ASSIGN TO "diag/reconciliation.rpt" ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS WS-FS.
    SELECT O-RPT ASSIGN TO "work/out/reconciliation.rpt" ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS WS-FS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD D-RPT. 01 D-REC PIC X(200).
FD O-RPT. 01 O-REC PIC X(200).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY CAPS.
COPY LEDGER.
01 WS-FS PIC XX.
01 WS-LINE PIC X(200).
01 WS-I PIC 9(3).
01 WS-OP PIC X(8).
01 WS-AMT PIC S9(13)V99.
01 WS-ST PIC 9.
01 WS-N1 PIC 9(9).
01 WS-N2 PIC 9(9).
01 WS-N3 PIC 9(9).
01 WS-N4 PIC 9(9).
01 WS-IDENT PIC X(4).
01 WS-RC PIC 9(2).
01 WS-STATUS PIC X(4).
LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY TMSTATE.
01 LK-NAME PIC X(60).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING TMSTATE LK-NAME.
MAIN-PARA.
    OPEN OUTPUT D-RPT
    IF TM-MODE NOT = "V" AND TM-RC < 12
        OPEN OUTPUT O-RPT
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
    STRING "RUN " FUNCTION TRIM(LK-NAME) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
    PERFORM EMIT
    IF TM-RC < 12
        PERFORM BODY-LINES
    END-IF
    MOVE TM-RC TO WS-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
    STRING "RC " WS-RC DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
    *> RC is printed without padding: "RC 0", "RC 12".
    IF WS-RC < 10
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
        STRING "RC " WS-RC(2:1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
    END-IF
    PERFORM EMIT
    IF TM-RC = 12
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
        STRING "CAUSE " FUNCTION TRIM(TM-CAUSE) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
        PERFORM EMIT
    END-IF
    CLOSE D-RPT
    IF TM-MODE NOT = "V" AND TM-RC < 12
        CLOSE O-RPT
    END-IF
    GOBACK.

BODY-LINES.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > TM-NCOH
        PERFORM GET-COHORT
        IF TC-STATUS(WS-I) = "P"
            MOVE "PASS" TO WS-STATUS
        ELSE
            MOVE "HELD" TO WS-STATUS
        END-IF
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
        STRING "COHORT " FUNCTION TRIM(TC-CODE(WS-I))
            " detail_read=" WS-N1 " written=" WS-N2 " rejected=" WS-N3
            " held=" WS-N4 " status=" WS-STATUS " reason="
            FUNCTION TRIM(TC-REASON(WS-I)) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
        PERFORM EMIT
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE LG-GETCTRL TO WS-OP
    PERFORM CALL-LEDGER
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-N1
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
    STRING "CONTROL records=" WS-N1 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
    PERFORM EMIT
    MOVE 0 TO WS-I
    PERFORM GET-COHORT
    MOVE LG-CHKIDENT TO WS-OP
    PERFORM CALL-LEDGER
    IF WS-ST = 0
        MOVE "OK" TO WS-IDENT
    ELSE
        MOVE "FAIL" TO WS-IDENT
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
    STRING "TOTAL detail_read=" WS-N1 " written=" WS-N2 " rejected=" WS-N3
        " held=" WS-N4 " identity=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-IDENT)
        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
    PERFORM EMIT
    PERFORM ROWS-LINE VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 4
    MOVE LG-GETWARN TO WS-OP
    PERFORM CALL-LEDGER
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-N1
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
    STRING "WARNINGS unused_panel_slots=" WS-N1 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
    PERFORM EMIT.

ROWS-LINE.
    MOVE LG-GETROWS TO WS-OP
    PERFORM CALL-LEDGER
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-N1
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
    EVALUATE WS-I
        WHEN 1 STRING "ROWS patients.csv=" WS-N1 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
        WHEN 2 STRING "ROWS lab_results.csv=" WS-N1 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
        WHEN 3 STRING "ROWS adverse_events.csv=" WS-N1 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
        WHEN 4 STRING "ROWS reject.csv=" WS-N1 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
    END-EVALUATE
    PERFORM EMIT.

*> WS-I = cohort index (0 = total). Fills WS-N1..N4 = read, written, rejected, held.
GET-COHORT.
    MOVE LG-GETREAD TO WS-OP
    PERFORM CALL-LEDGER
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-N1
    MOVE LG-GETWRIT TO WS-OP
    PERFORM CALL-LEDGER
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-N2
    MOVE LG-GETREJT TO WS-OP
    PERFORM CALL-LEDGER
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-N3
    MOVE LG-GETHELD TO WS-OP
    PERFORM CALL-LEDGER
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-N4.

CALL-LEDGER.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-AMT
    CALL "LEDGER" USING WS-OP WS-I WS-AMT WS-ST.

EMIT.
    MOVE WS-LINE TO D-REC
    WRITE D-REC
    IF TM-MODE NOT = "V" AND TM-RC < 12
        MOVE WS-LINE TO O-REC
        WRITE O-REC
    END-IF.
